OL,3,ABadenoch plans #10bn UK air defence
OL,4,Asystem, as she promises savings on
OL,5,Awelfare and net zero
OL,6,
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch is
OL,8,Fspeaking to BBC Breakfast at 07:30 BST
OL,9,Fand will also talk to Radio 4's Today
OL,10,Fprogramme at 08:10 BST - follow along
OL,11,Fhere or watch live at the top of this
OL,12,Fpage
OL,14,FThe Tories are holding their party
OL,15,Fconference in Birmingham this week,
OL,16,Fwith Badenoch set to give her keynote
OL,17,Fspeech on Wednesday
OL,19,FIt comes as the Conservatives have
OL,20,Fpledged to invest #10bn in a "British
OL,21,FIron Dome" air defence system if they
OL,22,Fwin the next general election
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
